# An AgentMessage: a point-to-point message between two agents. 56 bytes:
#   +0 id (a fresh UUID from agent_id_new), +8 sender, +16 receiver (agent
#   ids, as given), +24 correlation_id (Str, 0), +32 reply_to (Str, 0),
